    "inner": "<div class=\"text-pane\">\n      <div class=\"eyebrow\">SEGMENT 01 &middot; 20 MIN</div>\n      <h1 class=\"slide-title\">Introduction &amp;<br/>Requirement Gathering</h1>\n      <div class=\"tech-list\">\n        <div class=\"tech-item\">\n          <div class=\"tech-num\">1</div>\n          <div><div class=\"tech-name\">Fully live</div><div class=\"tech-desc\">Every screen you'll see is a real, running system &mdash; not slides pretending to be a demo.</div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tech-item\">\n          <div class=\"tech-num\">2</div>\n          <div><div class=\"tech-name\">One requirement, start to finish</div><div class=\"tech-desc\">The same billing system moves through every segment today &mdash; gather, choose, build, deploy, run.</div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tech-item\">\n          <div class=\"tech-num\">3</div>\n          <div><div class=\"tech-name\">Ask anytime</div><div class=\"tech-desc\">Questions go through Pigeonhole throughout &mdash; you don't have to wait for the Q&amp;A slot.</div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tech-item\">\n          <div class=\"tech-num\">4</div>\n          <div><div class=\"tech-name\">Four angles, one panel</div><div class=\"tech-desc\">Enterprise banking infrastructure, data architecture, product management, and hands-on engineering.</div></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"meta-row\" style=\"margin-top:16px;\">\n        <div class=\"meta-item\"><div class=\"meta-label\">SPEAKER</div><div class=\"meta-value\">Manikandan</div></div>\n        <div class=\"meta-item\"><div class=\"meta-label\">TIME</div><div class=\"meta-value\">9:50 &ndash; 10:10 AM</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"canvas-pane\" data-scene-id=\"c2\"></div>"
  },
  {
    "attrs": {
