    "inner": "<div class=\"text-pane\">\n      <div class=\"sheet-stamp\"><span class=\"stamp-num\">02</span><span class=\"stamp-of\">of 8 modules</span></div>\n      <h1 class=\"divider-title\">Technology Selection</h1>\n      <p class=\"divider-desc\">Choosing the right frontend framework and backend language, and how the choice is really made.</p>\n      <div class=\"divider-contents\"><div class=\"divider-content-item\">Frontend Technology</div><div class=\"divider-content-item\">Backend Technology</div><div class=\"divider-content-item\">How to Choose</div></div>\n    </div>"
  },
  {
    "attrs": {
      "class": "slide",
      "id": "slide-4",
      "data-seg": "2",
      "data-expand": "frontend"
    },
    "inner": "<div class=\"text-pane\">\n      <div class=\"eyebrow\">SEGMENT 02 &middot; FRONTEND TECHNOLOGY &middot; 7 MIN</div>\n      <h1 class=\"slide-title\" style=\"font-size:clamp(28px,3.6vw,44px);\">Frontend<br/>Technology</h1>\n      <div class=\"tech-list\">\n        <div class=\"tech-item tech-clickable\" data-tech=\"react\">\n          <div class=\"tech-num\">1</div>\n          <div><div class=\"tech-name\">React <span class=\"tech-hint\">tutorial</span></div><div class=\"tech-desc\">Massive ecosystem and hiring pool. The default choice for most product teams.</div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tech-item tech-clickable\" data-tech=\"angular\">\n          <div class=\"tech-num\">2</div>\n          <div><div class=\"tech-name\">Angular <span class=\"tech-hint\">tutorial</span></div><div class=\"tech-desc\">Batteries-included, TypeScript-first. Best for large enterprise teams needing structure.</div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tech-item tech-clickable\" data-tech=\"vue\">\n          <div class=\"tech-num\">3</div>\n          <div><div class=\"tech-name\">Vue <span class=\"tech-hint\">tutorial</span></div><div class=\"tech-desc\">Gentle learning curve, flexible. Great for small-to-mid teams shipping fast.</div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tech-item tech-clickable\" data-tech=\"svelte\">\n          <div class=\"tech-num\">4</div>\n          <div><div class=\"tech-name\">Svelte <span class=\"tech-hint\">tutorial</span></div><div class=\"tech-desc\">Compiles away at build time, smallest bundles. Best when performance is the top priority.</div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tech-item tech-clickable\" data-tech=\"nextjs\">\n          <div class=\"tech-num\">5</div>\n          <div><div class=\"tech-name\">Next.js <span class=\"tech-hint\">tutorial</span></div><div class=\"tech-desc\">React plus routing, SSR, and static generation built in. Best for SEO-heavy or full-stack apps.</div></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"meta-row\" style=\"margin-top:16px;\">\n        <div class=\"meta-item\"><div class=\"meta-label\">SPEAKER</div><div class=\"meta-value\">Manikandan</div></div>\n        <div class=\"meta-item\"><div class=\"meta-label\">DURATION</div><div class=\"meta-value\">7 min</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"back-link compare-link\" data-compare-group=\"frontend\" style=\"margin-top:14px;\">See full comparison table &rarr;</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"canvas-pane\" data-scene-id=\"c4\"></div>"
  },
  {
    "attrs": {
      "class": "slide",
      "id": "slide-5",
      "data-seg": "2",
      "data-expand": "backend"
    },
    "inner": "<div class=\"text-pane\">\n      <div class=\"eyebrow\">SEGMENT 02 &middot; BACKEND TECHNOLOGY &middot; 7 MIN</div>\n      <h1 class=\"slide-title\" style=\"font-size:clamp(28px,3.6vw,44px);\">Backend<br/>Technology</h1>\n      <div class=\"tech-list\">\n        <div class=\"tech-item tech-clickable\" data-tech=\"java\">\n          <div class=\"tech-num\">1</div>\n          <div><div class=\"tech-name\">Java / Spring <span class=\"tech-hint\">tutorial</span></div><div class=\"tech-desc\">Verbose but rock-solid. Huge hiring pool. Runs untouched for years.</div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tech-item tech-clickable\" data-tech=\"csharp\">\n          <div class=\"tech-num\">2</div>\n          <div><div class=\"tech-name\">C# / .NET <span class=\"tech-hint\">tutorial</span></div><div class=\"tech-desc\">Same strengths as Java, nicer tooling, fully cross-platform now.</div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tech-item tech-clickable\" data-tech=\"python\">\n          <div class=\"tech-num\">3</div>\n          <div><div class=\"tech-name\">Python / Django <span class=\"tech-hint\">tutorial</span></div><div class=\"tech-desc\">Fastest to a working system. Free admin screens. Weaker on huge domains.</div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tech-item tech-clickable\" data-tech=\"node\">\n          <div class=\"tech-num\">4</div>\n          <div><div class=\"tech-name\">Node / TypeScript <span class=\"tech-hint\">tutorial</span></div><div class=\"tech-desc\">One language front to back. Fast hiring, but watch dependency churn.</div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tech-item tech-clickable\" data-tech=\"go\">\n          <div class=\"tech-num\">5</div>\n          <div><div class=\"tech-name\">Go <span class=\"tech-hint\">tutorial</span></div><div class=\"tech-desc\">Single binary, trivial to deploy. Best for infrastructure-heavy systems.</div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tech-item tech-clickable\" data-tech=\"php\">\n          <div class=\"tech-num\">6</div>\n          <div><div class=\"tech-name\">PHP / Laravel <span class=\"tech-hint\">tutorial</span></div><div class=\"tech-desc\">Cheapest hosting, huge SME footprint. Do not sneer, it ships.</div></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"meta-row\" style=\"margin-top:14px;\">\n        <div class=\"meta-item\"><div class=\"meta-label\">SPEAKER</div><div class=\"meta-value\">Manikandan</div></div>\n        <div class=\"meta-item\"><div class=\"meta-label\">DURATION</div><div class=\"meta-value\">7 min</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"back-link compare-link\" data-compare-group=\"backend\" style=\"margin-top:14px;\">See full comparison table &rarr;</div>\n      <h3 style=\"margin-top:16px;\">Request / Response Flow</h3>\n      <svg id=\"sketch-request-response\" width=\"100%\" height=\"130\" viewBox=\"0 0 460 130\" style=\"max-width:460px;\"></svg>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"canvas-pane\" data-scene-id=\"c5\"></div>"
  },
  {
    "attrs": {
      "class": "slide",
      "id": "slide-6",
      "data-seg": "2",
      "data-expand": "choose"
