    "inner": "<div class=\"text-pane\">\n      <div class=\"eyebrow\">SEGMENT 02 &middot; HOW TO CHOOSE &middot; 6 MIN</div>\n      <h1 class=\"slide-title\" style=\"font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,40px);\">How the Choice<br/>Is Really Made</h1>\n      <div class=\"tech-list\">\n        <div class=\"tech-item tech-clickable\" data-tech=\"hire\">\n          <div class=\"tech-num\">1</div>\n          <div><div class=\"tech-name\">Who can we hire, years from now? <span class=\"tech-hint\">tutorial</span></div><div class=\"tech-desc\">The system outlives its author. Hiring pool beats elegance.</div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tech-item tech-clickable\" data-tech=\"teamskill\">\n          <div class=\"tech-num\">2</div>\n          <div><div class=\"tech-name\">What does the team already know? <span class=\"tech-hint\">tutorial</span></div><div class=\"tech-desc\">A second system in a familiar language beats a first in a better one.</div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tech-item tech-clickable\" data-tech=\"ecosystem\">\n          <div class=\"tech-num\">3</div>\n          <div><div class=\"tech-name\">Does the ecosystem fit the domain? <span class=\"tech-hint\">tutorial</span></div><div class=\"tech-desc\">Ready-made libraries for your exact problem remove weeks of work.</div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tech-item tech-clickable\" data-tech=\"operate\">\n          <div class=\"tech-num\">4</div>\n          <div><div class=\"tech-name\">How hard is it to operate? <span class=\"tech-hint\">tutorial</span></div><div class=\"tech-desc\">Fewer moving parts, fewer 9 p.m. phone calls.</div></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"callout\">\n        <strong>The reason that should not decide it:</strong> \"Which one is fastest?\" At real-world\n        scale, every modern option on the list is fast enough.\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"meta-row\" style=\"margin-top:14px;\">\n        <div class=\"meta-item\"><div class=\"meta-label\">SPEAKER</div><div class=\"meta-value\">Manikandan</div></div>\n        <div class=\"meta-item\"><div class=\"meta-label\">DURATION</div><div class=\"meta-value\">6 min</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"canvas-pane\" data-scene-id=\"c6\"></div>"
  },
  {
    "attrs": {
      "class": "slide module-divider",
      "id": "divider-3",
