    "inner": "<div class=\"text-pane\">\n      <div class=\"sheet-stamp\"><span class=\"stamp-num\">03</span><span class=\"stamp-of\">of 8 modules</span></div>\n      <h1 class=\"divider-title\">Database</h1>\n      <p class=\"divider-desc\">Relational, document, and key-value databases, and when to reach for each one.</p>\n      <div class=\"divider-contents\"><div class=\"divider-content-item\">Relational Databases</div><div class=\"divider-content-item\">NoSQL & Distributed Databases</div></div>\n    </div>"
  },
  {
    "attrs": {
      "class": "slide",
      "id": "slide-7",
      "data-seg": "3",
      "data-expand": "database"
    },
    "inner": "<div class=\"text-pane\">\n      <div class=\"eyebrow\">SEGMENT 03 &middot; 20 MIN</div>\n      <h1 class=\"slide-title\" style=\"font-size:clamp(28px,3.6vw,44px);\">Database:<br/>Live Build</h1>\n      <div class=\"tech-list\">\n        <div class=\"tech-item tech-clickable\" data-tech=\"postgresql\">\n          <div class=\"tech-num\">1</div>\n          <div><div class=\"tech-name\">PostgreSQL <span class=\"tech-hint\">tutorial</span></div><div class=\"tech-desc\">Relational. Open-source, built for correctness. The default choice for structured, must-be-right data.</div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tech-item tech-clickable\" data-tech=\"mysql\">\n          <div class=\"tech-num\">2</div>\n          <div><div class=\"tech-name\">MySQL <span class=\"tech-hint\">tutorial</span></div><div class=\"tech-desc\">Relational. The most widely hosted open-source database, huge SME footprint.</div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tech-item tech-clickable\" data-tech=\"mssql\">\n          <div class=\"tech-num\">3</div>\n          <div><div class=\"tech-name\">MS SQL Server <span class=\"tech-hint\">tutorial</span></div><div class=\"tech-desc\">Relational. Microsoft's enterprise database, deep .NET integration.</div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tech-item tech-clickable\" data-tech=\"oracle\">\n          <div class=\"tech-num\">4</div>\n          <div><div class=\"tech-name\">Oracle <span class=\"tech-hint\">tutorial</span></div><div class=\"tech-desc\">Relational. The backbone of large legacy enterprises &mdash; banking, telecom, government.</div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tech-item tech-clickable\" data-tech=\"mongodb\">\n          <div class=\"tech-num\">5</div>\n          <div><div class=\"tech-name\">MongoDB <span class=\"tech-hint\">tutorial</span></div><div class=\"tech-desc\">Document. Flexible JSON-like records instead of rigid tables &mdash; good when the shape of data varies.</div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"tech-item tech-clickable\" data-tech=\"redis\">\n          <div class=\"tech-num\">6</div>\n          <div><div class=\"tech-name\">Redis <span class=\"tech-hint\">tutorial</span></div><div class=\"tech-desc\">Key-Value. Near-instant lookups by a key you know. Caching only, never your main record.</div></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"callout\"><strong>Three shapes, three jobs:</strong> Relational (structured tables), Document (flexible JSON), Key-Value (instant lookups). Pick based on how you'll query the data, not habit.</div>\n      <div class=\"meta-row\" style=\"margin-top:14px;\">\n        <div class=\"meta-item\"><div class=\"meta-label\">SPEAKERS</div><div class=\"meta-value\">Mathavan / Manikandan</div></div>\n        <div class=\"meta-item\"><div class=\"meta-label\">TIME</div><div class=\"meta-value\">10:30 &ndash; 10:50 AM</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"back-link compare-link\" data-compare-group=\"database\" style=\"margin-top:14px;\">See full comparison table &rarr;</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"canvas-pane\" data-scene-id=\"c7\"></div>"
  },
  {
    "attrs": {
      "class": "slide module-divider",
